param_funcs: parameter functions whose rule differs between the two (VACASK's sgn of 0 is 1, pow of a negative base, a rounding of a half, abs, sqrt, exp, ln) as source values, one node each
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
parameters s0=sgn(0.0)+2.0 pw=pow(-2.0, 2.0) rn=round(2.5) ab=abs(-3.0) sq=sqrt(16.0) ex=exp(0.0) lg=ln(exp(2.0))
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=s0
v2 (b 0) vsource dc=pw
v3 (c 0) vsource dc=rn
v4 (d 0) vsource dc=ab
v5 (e 0) vsource dc=sq
v6 (f 0) vsource dc=ex
v7 (g 0) vsource dc=lg
r1 (a b) resistor r=1k
r2 (c d) resistor r=1k
r3 (e f) resistor r=1k
r4 (g 0) resistor r=1k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
